    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "咦......Rosmontis，你在做什么？",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "咦......Rosmontis，你在做什么？"
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",fadetime=1,block=true)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "fadetime": "1,block=true"
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[Delay(time=1.5)]",
        "type": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"Rosmontis\"]  我......我想修好这个便携终端。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Rosmontis",
        "content": "我......我想修好这个便携终端。"
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[name=\"Rosmontis\"]  六年前到去年的记忆我都记在这里了......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Rosmontis",
        "content": "六年前到去年的记忆我都记在这里了......"
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[name=\"Rosmontis\"]  今天早上，我想读六月十二号记录的时候，屏幕突然就不亮了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Rosmontis",
        "content": "今天早上，我想读六月十二号记录的时候，屏幕突然就不亮了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[name=\"Rosmontis\"]  如果......如果真的再读不了......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Rosmontis",
        "content": "如果......如果真的再读不了......"
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[name=\"Rosmontis\"]  三月十四号和爸爸去植物园，七月的登山，还有第四个四月，妈妈......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Rosmontis",
        "content": "三月十四号和爸爸去植物园，七月的登山，还有第四个四月，妈妈......"
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"Rosmontis\"]  ......妈妈......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Rosmontis",
        "content": "......妈妈......"
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "别，别哭！那个啥，你不太擅长用电子屏幕对吧？",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "别，别哭！那个啥，你不太擅长用电子屏幕对吧？"
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "为什么不等Scout来帮你修一下呢？可露希尔也可以啊？",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "为什么不等Scout来帮你修一下呢？可露希尔也可以啊？"
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "我帮你拿给可露希尔吧，几分钟就搞定啦！",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "我帮你拿给可露希尔吧，几分钟就搞定啦！"
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[name=\"Rosmontis\"]  Scout是......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Rosmontis",
        "content": "Scout是......"
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"Rosmontis\"]  是那个吗，走路很轻的干员吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Rosmontis",
        "content": "是那个吗，走路很轻的干员吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "是他啊！有印象吗？",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "是他啊！有印象吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"Rosmontis\"]  嗯。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Rosmontis",
        "content": "嗯。"
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"Rosmontis\"]  给人很干净的感觉......像白色的瓷砖一样。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Rosmontis",
        "content": "给人很干净的感觉......像白色的瓷砖一样。"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[name=\"Rosmontis\"]  他就在那。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Rosmontis",
        "content": "他就在那。"
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "......啊？",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "......啊？"
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_026\",fadetime=1,block=true)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026",
        "fadetime": "1,block=true"
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[Delay(time=1)]",
        "type": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"Scout\"]  从没听过你对我的评价，现在才知道，原来我感受起来是这么脆弱。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Scout",
        "content": "从没听过你对我的评价，现在才知道，原来我感受起来是这么脆弱。"
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[CameraShake(duration=0.4, xstrength=10, ystrength=12, vibrato=30, randomness=90, fadeout=true, block=false)]",
        "type": "camera_shake",
        "duration": "0.4,",
        "xstrength": "10,",
        "ystrength": "12,",
        "vibrato": "30,",
        "randomness": "90,",
        "fadeout": "true,",
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "你什么时候来的？！",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "你什么时候来的？！"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_026\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026"
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"Scout\"]  可以说是一直都在。我习惯隐藏自己了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Scout",
        "content": "可以说是一直都在。我习惯隐藏自己了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"Rosmontis\"]  Scout先生他确实一直都在的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Rosmontis",
        "content": "Scout先生他确实一直都在的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[name=\"Rosmontis\"]  为什么煌没有感觉到呢？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Rosmontis",
        "content": "为什么煌没有感觉到呢？"
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "......我是比较粗线条，没看到啦！",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "......我是比较粗线条，没看到啦！"
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "不是，你听她说了那么久，怎么不帮她修下啊。",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "不是，你听她说了那么久，怎么不帮她修下啊。"
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_026\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026"
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"Scout\"]  抱歉，接下来我们有任务。我得花些精力校准武器。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Scout",
        "content": "抱歉，接下来我们有任务。我得花些精力校准武器。"
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"Scout\"]  你可能要请可露希尔或是机械师Mechanist先生去解决了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Scout",
        "content": "你可能要请可露希尔或是机械师Mechanist先生去解决了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "是那个，营救Dr.{@nickname}的任务吗？",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "是那个，营救Dr.{@nickname}的任务吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[PlaySound(key=\"$d_gen_walk_n\")]",
        "type": "play_sound",
        "key": "sound_beta_2/avg/d_gen_walk_n.mp3"
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_014_riope\",fadetime=1,block=true)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "fadetime": "1,block=true"
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[Delay(time=1)]",
        "type": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ace\"]  是。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ace",
        "content": "是。"
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "哦哦，你也来了。",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "哦哦，你也来了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_014_riope\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ace\"]  作为主要发起人之一，如果我自己都不去，罗德岛精英干员不是成了笑话？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ace",
        "content": "作为主要发起人之一，如果我自己都不去，罗德岛精英干员不是成了笑话？"
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_026\",name2=\"char_014_riope\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "raw": "[name=\"Scout\"]  阿斯卡纶怎么回复你的？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Scout",
        "content": "阿斯卡纶怎么回复你的？"
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_026\",name2=\"char_014_riope\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ace\"]  一样的托辞。她不会参与。同往常一样，她一直都和凯尔希站一边。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ace",
        "content": "一样的托辞。她不会参与。同往常一样，她一直都和凯尔希站一边。"
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_026\",name2=\"char_014_riope\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[name=\"Scout\"]  ......你有没有考虑过，现在可能不是最佳时机？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Scout",
        "content": "......你有没有考虑过，现在可能不是最佳时机？"
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_026\",name2=\"char_014_riope\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_026",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ace\"]  但这也可能是我们最后的机会。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ace",
        "content": "但这也可能是我们最后的机会。"
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ace\"]  为了躲避这次天灾，切尔诺伯格很可能会在驶离这里后，转向乌萨斯腹地。在乌萨斯内部展开营救，成功的概率趋近于零。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ace",
        "content": "为了躲避这次天灾，切尔诺伯格很可能会在驶离这里后，转向乌萨斯腹地。在乌萨斯内部展开营救，成功的概率趋近于零。"
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "听你们说了那么多回，这个Dr.{@nickname}真有那么神奇吗？",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "听你们说了那么多回，这个Dr.{@nickname}真有那么神奇吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_014_riope\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ace\"]  和阿米娅与凯尔希一样神奇。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ace",
        "content": "和阿米娅与凯尔希一样神奇。"
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_014_riope\",name2=\"avg_npc_042\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[name=\"Rosmontis\"]  我见过博士吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Rosmontis",
        "content": "我见过博士吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_014_riope\",name2=\"avg_npc_042\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ace\"]  没有。不过很快你就能见到了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ace",
        "content": "没有。不过很快你就能见到了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_014_riope\",name2=\"avg_npc_042\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 83,
        "raw": "[name=\"Rosmontis\"]  嗯。我也很想感受一下博士的样子。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Rosmontis",
        "content": "嗯。我也很想感受一下博士的样子。"
    },
    {
        "id": 84,
        "raw": "[name=\"Rosmontis\"]  很想。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Rosmontis",
        "content": "很想。"
    },
    {
        "id": 85,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_014_riope\",name2=\"avg_npc_042\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 86,
        "raw": "[name=\"Scout\"]  你会的，小猫。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Scout",
        "content": "你会的，小猫。"
    },
    {
        "id": 87,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 88,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 89,
        "raw": "对了，Ace。 你下辖小队里，有个叫灰喉的非患者。",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "对了，Ace。 你下辖小队里，有个叫灰喉的非患者。"
    },
    {
        "id": 90,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_014_riope\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "id": 91,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ace\"]  这事我记得。她应该还在单独舱室接受指导。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ace",
        "content": "这事我记得。她应该还在单独舱室接受指导。"
    },
    {
        "id": 92,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ace\"]  煌，听我一句。我带着她几个月了，她也许不太会表达，但绝对没有恶意。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ace",
        "content": "煌，听我一句。我带着她几个月了，她也许不太会表达，但绝对没有恶意。"
    },
    {
        "id": 93,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 94,
        "raw": "但她对我的队员说：“我不知道你们感染者有多痛苦。”",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "但她对我的队员说：“我不知道你们感染者有多痛苦。”"
    },
    {
        "id": 95,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_014_riope\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "id": 96,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ace\"]  我清楚。但她可能真的只是很疑惑，她想要去问这个问题。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ace",
        "content": "我清楚。但她可能真的只是很疑惑，她想要去问这个问题。"
    },
    {
        "id": 97,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ace\"]  我没资格要求干员立即明白我们的处境，而且，灰喉从没质疑过罗德岛的命令。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ace",
        "content": "我没资格要求干员立即明白我们的处境，而且，灰喉从没质疑过罗德岛的命令。"
    },
    {
        "id": 98,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 99,
        "raw": "其他我不管，我绝对不允许任何人侮辱我的队员，更别说诋毁罗德岛感染者们的奋斗了。",
        "type": "narration",
        "content": "其他我不管，我绝对不允许任何人侮辱我的队员，更别说诋毁罗德岛感染者们的奋斗了。"
    },
